g風</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>1</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">孫翊倫<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_39.html\" target=\"_blank\">體會</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">2</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">周碧玲<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/tshiak.html\" target=\"_blank\">Tshia̍k猴——『過動兒』</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">3</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">何明洲<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/be_15.html\" target=\"_blank\">阮bē記--得--你</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>4</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">景景<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_87.html\" target=\"_blank\">Siàu念阮阿公　有孝阮阿媽</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>46</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_20.html\" target=\"_blank\">菅芒</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>5</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／劉承賢</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／陳亮穎<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_81.html\" target=\"_blank\">講語法真夯枷？</a><br /><span>6</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sann-kap讀小說</span></h3><div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蔡秀英</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_91.html\" target=\"_blank\">手指（上）</a><br /><span>8</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Aminegy Khó͘<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span></span></div><div><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/khin-kho-tai.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Khin-khó-tāi</span></a></div><div><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/khin-kho-tai.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">輕可代</span></a></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">43</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣好食mi̍h</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">吳雪如<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_14.html\" target=\"_blank\">辦桌</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>12</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">李玉鳳<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_51.html\" target=\"_blank\">鹹冬瓜</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>13</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳燕卿<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/12/blog-post_16.html\" target=\"_blank\">虱目魚</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>15</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Bóng講笑</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳文仲<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/50e.html\" target=\"_blank\">50冬前ê鐵枝路跤</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>17</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ǹg夢五四三</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳馬克<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_67.html\" target=\"_blank\">夢想</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>18</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">文學káng「台」</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">石牧民<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_21.html\" target=\"_blank\">歌仔冊ê新聞性質</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>20</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">地名研究室</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">黃偉嘉<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/peh-sua-tun.html\" target=\"_blank\">白沙屯（Pe̍h-sua-tun）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>23</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心內話</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">顏月華<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/katthau.html\" target=\"_blank\">Kat，tháu放</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>24</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張吟平<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_23.html\" target=\"_blank\">謝師恩</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>26</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">黃品筑<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_23.html\" target=\"_blank\">我～愛我ê台灣母語</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>28</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">闕嘉蓁 （Khuat Ka-tsin）<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/beh.html\" target=\"_blank\">看電視劇決心beh學台語文</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>29</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">光景bóng uē</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳榮廷<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_69.html\" target=\"_blank\">三峽ê大學花園城</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>30</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">黃明勝<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_26.html\" target=\"_blank\">我愛高雄</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>33</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">生活ê藝術</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蕭聿萱<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_36.html\" target=\"_blank\">解夢大師</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>35</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣人寫真</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">莊詠丞<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_26.html\" target=\"_blank\">海湧ê願望</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>38</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蔡頌恩<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_48.html\" target=\"_blank\">台灣『拉赫曼尼諾夫』——蕭泰然</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>39</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">黃桂蘭<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/chitekah-chiah-ni.html\" target=\"_blank\">Chit條線哪ē牽kah chiah-nī長</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span>40</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">寫hō͘學生朋友ê代誌</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳雷<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_57.html\" target=\"_blank\">好額ê迷思</a></span></div><div><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_57.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hó-gia̍h ê Bê-su</span></a></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">44</span></div></div><div style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><br /></div></div></span></div><div><span><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgXo0Q8NL7L9i0RX05LwUhmqKTcT5wOij6vLcadvdPNgMsCIObk1Vu5NYoSSvtcgWHrYKCGlgKYSE49BeIq5MoPsR9NR7a_l2AmTWfse0gNLQmMWTuYadHYK72yCPHG-rW1aZ0jwZwu-FGVTv2Y0uggaJ1UmVzX63XMtRSacsKn2gRntFBaYMsbp5dz6g/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1345%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%81.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgXo0Q8NL7L9i0RX05LwUhmqKTcT5wOij6vLcadvdPNgMsCIObk1Vu5NYoSSvtcgWHrYKCGlgKYSE49BeIq5MoPsR9NR7a_l2AmTWfse0gNLQmMWTuYadHYK72yCPHG-rW1aZ0jwZwu-FGVTv2Y0uggaJ1UmVzX63XMtRSacsKn2gRntFBaYMsbp5dz6g/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1345%E6%